  "_note": "The canary for C4, and the same job `testpack:horse` did for C2. It is in `ranged_slow` on purpose \u2014 the same slot as the bolt rifle \u2014 because that slot's own note has said `bolt rifle, musket, crossbow, bow` since C1, and this is that claim being cashed rather than restated. If firing it needs one line of core code the rifle did not need, the eras-are-data bet is broken and this file is where it shows.",
